<title>JAPAN: Dai-ichi Mutual to buy Y50-100 bln foreign bonds.</title>
<headline>Dai-ichi Mutual to buy Y50-100 bln foreign bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dai-ichi Mutual Life Insurance Co plans 50 billion to 100 billion yen worth of new foreign bond investment in the second half of the current business year, a company official told reporters on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
